  "Solution": {
    "S": "The shape of $\\mathrm{BrF_5}$ is square pyramidal. Bromine has 5 bonding pairs and 1 lone pair of electrons (from VSEPR theory), giving an octahedral electron geometry and square pyramidal molecular geometry. Hence the correct option is C."
